     "items": [
      {
       "type": "lesson",
       "id": "341a26d0a74543cfad0e1324558a5318",
       "n": 18,
       "title": "✨ Upscaling to 4k",
       "html": "<p>This is something a lot of people sleep on 👇</p><p>You don’t need to keep generating the same image over and over trying to get it “sharper” or “more real.”</p><p>If you already have a good base image — if its not perfect or slightly blurred —NanoBanana Pro or GPT image 2.0 will upscale it to true 4K while keeping the original vision intact.</p><p>🔧 What they do that other upscalers don’t:</p><li><p>Keeps the original style &amp; character identity (it doesn’t repaint)</p></li><li><p>Adds realistic micro-details — skin pores, hair texture, fabric fibers, fine edges</p></li><li><p>Cleans compression noise + blurry patches</p></li><li><p>Preserves composition, lighting, and form</p></li><p>So for example, if you generate an image that you LOVE, but the quality isn&#39;t quite there, you can just upload to the image models and increase it within seconds. This applies for all images, not just faces.</p><p>💥REMEMBER you need to UPSCALE before you animate! </p><p>The higher the quality of the image you throw into the video generators the more pixels it has to work with, meaning the end result is overall higher quality.</p><p>I always upscale images for:</p><li><p>Portraits</p></li><li><p>All of my FILMS</p></li><li><p>All of my ADS</p></li><li><p>Product shots</p></li><li><p>Frames I’m sending for animation</p></li><p>You can use a simple prompt like 👇</p><p>&#39;Upscale this image to true ultra-realistic 4K. Preserve the original composition, lighting, and character identity.&#39;</p><p>Or you can use Promptwise inbuilt upscaler (Phase 6)</p><p>Hope this helps 🚀</p><img src=\"media/8b2bf1321c66cdce4f51.jpg\" alt=\"8cefc5b1-afee-4980-831b-d2486d6e3a07 (1).png\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"media/f90379cade58590349fc.jpg\" alt=\"ce1c57ea-ff47-4159-98d6-efa92c3a9806 (2).png\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"media/e77baeb361f1f847c7aa.jpg\" alt=\"7e34ae1e-e8f0-43ba-85b7-28238d7cce25 (1).png\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"media/529e11f86d4a18cef72c.jpg\" alt=\"8595e3ec-9235-43ad-91f4-3c1bb421940c (1).png\" loading=\"lazy\">",
       "resources": [],
       "posts": [],
       "video": null
      },
